{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Help won't arrive right away, and people are hungry. Let's deliver pizzas&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Pizza Deathlivery, an opaque mist has descended over the city for several days, and monsters have begun to emerge. Those still alive are running out of food...and <strong>you're their last hope</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your mission? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Pick up a pizza, deliver it and take the money back to the pizzeria!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new day begins with a quantity of pizza to be delivered. Once you've opened the door to the pizzeria, you must deliver all the pizzas before midnight. If you don't reach your quota, the boss won't be happy...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Finding your way around and avoiding the monsters!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new run generates a randomized city, so you have to find your way around despite the fog that prevents you from seeing more than few meters away, and watch out for the creatures that swarm the streets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in it for you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Money,</span> everyone's survival!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day, if you deliver the required quota of pizzas, you'll gain reputation, unlocking new locations and equipment. With each delivery, the money you earn will enable you to buy this equipment or transform the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY POINTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online cooperation from 2 to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A randomly generated city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zany, multi-functional objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terrifying monsters with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pizza (a lot)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697560?t=1747749326","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697560?t=1747749326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697560/9704486ba5c424a6f84521c84bede2c96c2723c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747749326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697560/9704486ba5c424a6f84521c84bede2c96c2723c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747749326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Help won't arrive right away, and people are hungry. Let's deliver pizzas&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Pizza Deathlivery, an opaque mist has descended over the city for several days, and monsters have begun to emerge. Those still alive are running out of food...and <strong>you're their last hope</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your mission? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Pick up a pizza, deliver it and take the money back to the pizzeria!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new day begins with a quantity of pizza to be delivered. Once you've opened the door to the pizzeria, you must deliver all the pizzas before midnight. If you don't reach your quota, the boss won't be happy...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Finding your way around and avoiding the monsters!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new run generates a randomized city, so you have to find your way around despite the fog that prevents you from seeing more than few meters away, and watch out for the creatures that swarm the streets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in it for you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Money,</span> everyone's survival!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day, if you deliver the required quota of pizzas, you'll gain reputation, unlocking new locations and equipment. With each delivery, the money you earn will enable you to buy this equipment or transform the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY POINTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online cooperation from 2 to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A randomly generated city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zany, multi-functional objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terrifying monsters with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pizza (a lot)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kusa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697560/09596d1d2c3a6967e1ef9599739b76ff489ffedb/header.jpg?t=1747749326","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Pizza Deathlivery","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460 or equivalen<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<